w is positive at $43.3m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-2.2% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue grew only 0.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-4.0% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $11.9m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000182709026000019/0001827090-26-000019-index.htm","accession":"0001827090-26-000019"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.6% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1827090/000214391526000002/0002143915-26-000002-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth f